### HABITS

### Get all habits by ascending order - WORKS
GET http://localhost:5050/habits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": 1
}

### Create a habit - WORKS
POST http://localhost:5050/habits
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mock Habit 4",
  "description": "Some description of Mock Habit 4",
  "userId": 1
}

### Update a habit - WORKS
PUT http://localhost:5050/habits/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Mock Habit 1",
  "description": "Updated habit description for Mock Habit 1"
}


### Delete a habit - WORKS
DELETE http://localhost:5050/habits/4
Content-Type: application/json




### TASKS

